              "handle": "nicopreme"
            },
            "text": "Hot take: Pi has extensions because I wanted an undo button.\n\nLast December I opened a PR for Pi to snapshot every turn so jumping backwards in a convo could restore your file changes. Mario said no to adding it to core, then floated: \"hooks could be a way to actually extend pi.\"",
