          "topic": "Whether changing model and thinking effort mid-thread helps agent work",
          "text": "I might be missing something, because I haven't done it in the last two years, but:\n\nAre there really any benefits to switching the model and the thinking effort mid-thread?\n\nWhenever someone tells me they're doing this, my reaction is they're probably doing something wrong.",
