          "published_at": "2026-11-07T11:43:43.460Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/thorstenball/status/2119033049803338184",
          "topic": "Amp Spaces interaction workflow for coding agents",
          "text": "We shipped this yesterday and the feedback so far has been incredible. Makes me very happy.",
          "attachments": [],
          "quote_tweet": {
            "url": "https://x.com/lewis_b_metcalf/status/2118771481245307177",
