            "text": "🎙️ State of Agentic Coding w/ @mitsuhiko returns:\n\nIn episode #12:\n- models we're using now\n- is local desktop software dead?\n- time to hoard PS5s?\n- debating @thorstenball's \"how I work with agents\"\n\nand much more 👇",
